s chez l'adversaire : 31 % de ses touches dans le dernier tiers."],"impact":"Le plan {T:home:de} a tenu jusqu'au bout. Les positions moyennes ne disent pas tout, mais elles disent qui occupait le terrain."},"en":{"lead":"On paper, {T:home:sub} lined up in a 4-4-2. On the pitch, in possession, it looked more like a 3-3-2-2. {T:away:sub} announced a 4-3-3 and attacked in a 3-4-3: a team sheet is a starting point, not a contract.","keys":["{T:home:sub} changes shape by phase: 3-3-2-2 with the ball, 4-3-3 without.","{T:away:sub} changes shape by phase: 3-4-3 with the ball, 4-2-4 without.","{T:home:pos} favourite lane: the centre (31% of touches).","{T:away:pos} favourite lane: the left wing (23% of touches).","{T:away:sub} camped in the opponent's half: 31% of touches in the final third."],"impact":"{T:home:pos} plan held to the end. Average positions do not say everything, but they say who owned the space."}},"s3":{"fr":{"lead":"Le pressing, c'était {T:away:sub} : un PPDA de 11,1, contre 13,3 en face. Comprendre : moins de passes laissées à l'adversaire avant de lui sauter dessus.","keys":["Réaction à la perte comparable : 27 % et 33 % des ballons perdus récupérés en moins de 5 s.","7 récupérations hautes pour {T:home:sub} (ballons perdus par l'adversaire dans ses 35 derniers mètres) : autant de départs d'actions à deux pas du but."],"impact":"Presser ne suffit pas : encore faut-il que les ballons récupérés se transforment. Ici, ils ne l'ont pas fait."},"en":{"lead":"The pressing came from {T:away:sub}: a PPDA of 11.1, against 13.3 for the opponents. Translation: fewer passes allowed before jumping on the ball.","keys":["Similar reaction to losing the ball: 27% and 33% won back within 5 s.","7 high regains for {T:home:sub} (balls lost by the opponent in their own 35 metres): that many attacks starting next to goal."],"impact":"Pressing is not enough: the regained balls still have to turn into something. Here, they did not."}},"s4":{"fr":{"lead":"Choc des philosophies : {T:home:sub} (+0,21) jouait autour du ballon, {T:away:sub} (−1,22) tenait ses postes.","keys":["{T:home:Sub} : 64 % de passes courtes (moins de 15 m), contre 53 % en moyenne.","Le carrefour du réseau {T:home:de} : Casemiro, impliqué dans 73 passes entre titulaires.","{T:away:Sub} : 36 % de passes courtes (moins de 15 m), contre 53 % en moyenne.","Le carrefour du réseau {T:away:de} : Carlos Salcedo, impliqué dans 95 passes entre titulaires."],"impact":"Et cette fois, c'est le football relationniste qui l'emporte. Ce n'est pas une loi, c'est un match."},"en":{"lead":"Clash of philosophies: {T:home:sub} (+0.21) played around the ball, {T:away:sub} (−1.22) held their positions.","keys":["{T:home:sub}: 64% short passes (under 15 m), against 53% on average.","The hub of {T:home:pos} network: Casemiro, involved in 73 passes between starters.","{T:away:sub}: 36% short passes (under 15 m), against 53% on average.","The hub of {T:away:pos} network: Carlos Salcedo, involved in 95 passes between starters."],"impact":"And this time, relational football wins. It is not a law, it is a match."}},"s5":{"fr":{"lead":"Perdre le ballon coûtait plus cher à {T:away:sub} : 5 tirs adverses en transition (1,38 xG), contre 6 pour l'autre camp.","keys":["But encaissé en transition par {T:away:sub} : 88'. Le repli arrivait en retard.","Sans 360, on ne voit pas les courses de repli : seuls les tirs concédés racontent l'histoire."],"impact":"Le match s'est en partie joué là : mieux gérer ses pertes, c'est souvent mieux gérer le score."},"en":{"lead":"Losing the ball cost {T:away:sub} more: 5 opponent shots in transition (1.38 xG), against 6 the other way.","keys":["Goal conceded in transition by {T:away:sub}: 88'. The recovery run came too late.","Without 360, recovery runs are invisible: only the shots conceded tell the story."],"impact":"Part of the match was decided right there: managing your losses is often managing the scoreline."}},"s6":{"fr":{"lead":"Sans 360, on mesure l'attention reçue : Hirving Lozano a subi 3,23 actions défensives de plus que la normale pour 10 touches.","keys":["Héctor Herrera ({T:away:bare}) : +3,04.","Carlos Vela ({T:away:bare}) : +2,58.","Roberto Firmino ({T:home:bare}) : +1,88.","À l'autre bout, Fágner (−1,73) a joué dans un relatif anonymat : parfois, c'est exactement ce qu'on cherche."],"impact":"Hirving Lozano a aspiré la défense, sans que personne n'en profite : de la gravité sans satellite."},"en":{"lead":"Without 360, we measure attention received: Hirving Lozano drew 3.23 more defensive actions than normal per 10 touches.","keys":["Héctor Herrera ({T:away:sub}): +3.04.","Carlos Vela ({T:away:sub}): +2.58.","Roberto Firmino ({T:home:sub}): +1.88.","At the other end, Fágner (−1.73) played in relative peace: sometimes that is exactly the point."],"impact":"Hirving Lozano pulled the defence in, but nobody cashed in: gravity without a satellite."}},"s7":{"fr":{"lead":"Menace créée balle au pied et à la passe (xT) : 1,83 pour {T:home:sub}, 1,32 pour {T:away:sub}. Le meilleur créateur : Willian, 0,62 xT à lui seul (34 % de la menace de son équipe).","keys":["Geste le plus menaçant {T:home:de} : une passe signée Willian à la 51e minute (+0,25 xT).","Geste le plus menaçant {T:away:de} : une conduite de balle signée Héctor Herrera à la 22e minute (+0,08 xT)."],"impact":"La menace a payé : {T:home:sub} a fait avancer le ballon plus dangereusement, et le score a suivi."},"en":{"lead":"Threat created by passes and carries (xT): 1.83 for {T:home:sub}, 1.32 for {T:away:sub}. Top creator: Willian, 0.62 xT on his own (34% of his team's threat).","keys":["{T:home:pos} most dangerous action: a pass by Willian in minute 51 (+0.25 xT).","{T:away:pos} most dangerous action: a carry by Héctor Herrera in minute 22 (+0.08 xT)."],"impact":"Threat paid off: {T:home:sub} moved the ball more dangerously, and the score followed."}},"s8":{"fr":{"lead":"Sur l'ensemble de la compétition, Neymar pointe au 1er rang des attaquants (sur 68). Ce match, 